        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86457, Modern Hexagon Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Hex Cabinet Knob has that mid-century modern appeal that is so popular in the design world. It is a great addition to any small door or drawer, be it on the bathroom vanity, on kitchen cabinets, or on a dresser revamp. This little Cabinet Mod Hex Knob will add big style. Choose from several modern finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86457-specifications.gif?v=1704354716\" width=\"600\" height=\"127\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86457 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-hex-cabinet-pull-emtek-86459\"><b>Modern Hex Cabinet Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/modern-hex-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-87003\"><b>Modern Hex Appliance Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/modern-hex-thru-bolt-pull-emtek-87003\"><b>Modern Hex Thru-Bolt Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Mod Hex Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86457: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86458: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
